  m_Name: A7_X3_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: What does this so called Sustainer do exactly?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Right, this is also the first time I\u2019ve heard about such a person."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ethan takes a few seconds to think.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Well, to sum it up, the Sustainer assures that the balance of the universe
      is not disturbed. They see to it that all the dimensions can coexist without
      any problems. You may have heard of parallel universes and such. It\u2019s
      something like that."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0a531472eb715104e8acc946d055c0dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e208844e9885aec48b359093b6d6432e, type: 2}
